Vibe VPN is a modern desktop VPN client UI prototype built with Python and Tkinter, featuring an Aurora-inspired design, an interactive globe, worldwide location selection, customizable themes, profile management, subscription plans, and performance optimizations.

Features

🌐 Interactive 3D-style globe and location browser

🎨 Customizable themes, colors, fonts, and app icons

⚡ Optimized UI rendering and page navigation

👤 Profile and subscription plan interfaces

🛡️ Security settings UI

📦 Windows executable packaging with PyInstaller

📄 EULA launcher integration

Technology

Python

Tkinter

Pillow

PyInstaller

Project status

Vibe VPN is currently a UI prototype. Real VPN connectivity, server infrastructure, payment processing, and network protection features require backend integration.

Note: Server locations, ping values, and connection statistics displayed in the interface may be demonstration data.

Built with a focus on privacy, performance, and a polished user experience.
